{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_4_002_06_h",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:4f99fb026db7f8802139c8d2d17afb4d87a85eed9d24e47aa814601466bfe43e",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_h:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f7f13995bebfe522c9144e7d8cdd86377faca9afda7d584bb5376ffecf4062d0",
      "text": "你这家伙……临阵脱逃也太逊了吧！\n堂堂正正地来跟我们决胜负啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_h:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:71ae93084bc4ab133a3c56bffa0c108d2b791f710e5ac2263ebb40bcb70131d9",
      "text": "穿着西装，摆着吓人的脸色让周围的人害怕。\n也许你确实是个超级了不起的大人物吧……。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_h:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5dc2b0319b99e18e8ca5f1aad0cba87a0d1d7650157869644627bf3f4e3b462b",
      "text": "但明知道可能做不好，\n却依然坚持去做的我们……。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_h:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ed276eb06d17a59a551e49f1f6241b97c4f14de4abab2baa53ef23ec32878206",
      "text": "说了要努力的直央，比起你这种家伙，\n可要强大几百倍帅气几百倍！所以……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_h:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bf194457c2569331d42425e4b980c2514e6acaf26c14566c4737a59e25018782",
      "text": "你，难道是315 Production的……。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_h:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fdd5edb7153d092634bf943df383bcc98618bb0c3946f39fc2bf7f74a35f6eca",
      "text": "志狼君，发生什么事了！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_h:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3f5a27d3bc078e67a840d9fe515600f5c6985457152c0e390941407d646eeb8c",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー！花音、直央……。\n呜……连、连工作人员也……。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_h:cmd-000083:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1ee671847c244f5b4472e4c6a1478ec606ca78916bf76e6f44174e9e50150c92",
      "text": "我……呜。对不起，●●●●プロデューサー。\n我太生气了，忍不住吼了出来……。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_h:cmd-000089:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f5e8310e4f45add2ce6fcb12d7ddd2b5c76d877e02d1deaa1a069ef38277ddc0",
      "text": "没事的，志狼君。没事的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_h:cmd-000094:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3a778f2ae1e0e8a73db4b05a8cfc593569c762059b2b4c87117ea9260dd0b4dd",
      "text": "那个……关于男极的事情，目前有几项在等待主办方的\n答复，请问该如何处理……。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_h:cmd-000097:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:72e54a9d74db0648b99d6d3b2a24c84e907623271ea8722b00b9ee3b231b1c4f",
      "text": "啧，我哪知道，别什么事都来向我请示！\n你们工作人员自己拿主意不就行了吗！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_h:cmd-000099:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9efc89620ef69ab3fc4832192273a7e8b02f5e0883e44776c3a50335dbafc46a",
      "text": "可、可是，如果负责人不定下来的话，\n大家心里都没底，工作根本无法推进啊……。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_h:cmd-000101:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:df0a045b30d579b5dd7abbdb538406479bd56d2fad7a1b14bc866676f52a92cc",
      "text": "那就让偶像负责。去台前\n抛头露面的是偶像吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_06:1_4_002_06_h:cmd-000110:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b5db2abbc1dd94bc9f6aca46e196ee6e5fa8a498d7b4cad37b0acc74608b20a8",
      "text": "请、请等一下！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
